WEBVTT

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:31.675
There has to be another way of doing this.

00:00:31.675 --> 00:00:33.710
We can't sustain suburbs,

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.275
so let's design a building

00:00:36.275 --> 00:00:39.518
which gives the qualities of a house

00:00:39.518 --> 00:00:40.689
to each unit.

00:00:40.689 --> 00:00:44.850
Habitat would be all about gardens,

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.755
contact with nature,

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.939
streets instead of corridors.

00:00:48.939 --> 00:00:52.737
We prefabricated it so we would achieve economy,

00:00:52.737 --> 00:00:57.980
and there it is almost 50 years later.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.351
It's a very desirable place to live in.